---

<section
  id="about"
  class="relative bg-background w-full max-w-screen-2xl text-center flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-20 sm:py-24"
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 w-full max-w-2xl justify-center items-center"
  >
    <div
      class="border h-[300px] w-[200px] bg-accent rotate-6 p-4 perfect-shadow animate-slide-in-left hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 cursor-pointer"
    >
      <img
        src="/assets/Dhanush.jpeg"
        alt="Your picture"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 animate-slide-in-right">
      <h2
        class="w-full text-left text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-pretty bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-foreground to-foreground animate-text-reveal"
      >
        More about me
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-full max-w-lg text-left text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed animate-text-fade-in flex flex-col gap-4"
      >
        <p>
          My path started with a BSc in Mathematics, Statistics & Computer Science —
          giving me something most AI engineers skip: a genuine understanding of
          <span class="text-primary font-medium">why models work</span>, not just how
          to call an API.
        </p>
    
        <p>
          That foundation led me into a <span class="text-primary font-medium">
          9-month intensive CRISP-ML(Q) program at 360DigiTMG</span> — covering
          machine learning, deep learning, NLP, time-series forecasting, and
          end-to-end ML workflows.
        </p>
    
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <p class="font-medium text-foreground">
            Since then, two back-to-back internships. Real systems. Real impact.
          </p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-muted-foreground">
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-primary mt-1">→</span>
              <span>
                <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Winit Software</span> —
                LLM-driven order pipeline processing 500+ daily orders, 21 business
                validation rules cutting errors by 45%, escalation automation
                reducing manual effort by 60%.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-primary mt-1">→</span>
              <span>
                <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Profolo</span> —
                Built core components of TalentGPT, an LLM-powered recruiter search
                engine — prompt engineering system, 7 Pinecone namespaces, deployed
                on AWS Lambda and SQS.
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
    
        <p class="text-muted-foreground border-l-2 border-primary pl-3 italic">
          I don't just use AI tools — I understand their internals, their failure
          modes, and how to engineer around them. That's what lets me adopt new
          frameworks fast, contribute from day one, and build systems that are
          accurate, scalable, and production-ready.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 w-full max-w-lg animate-text-fade-in">
        <div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-3 text-left bg-accent/30">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1">Strong fundamentals</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">The why, not just the how — math-first ML understanding</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-3 text-left bg-accent/30">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1">Production mindset</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Built for scale, reliability, and real enterprise workflows</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-3 text-left bg-accent/30">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1">LLM-native depth</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">RAG, GraphRAG, fine-tuning, agentic systems — not just wrappers</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-3 text-left bg-accent/30">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1">Fast adaptability</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">New frameworks, models, stacks — concept-first, ships fast</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 animate-button-slide-up">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dhanushmekala04"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="relative w-fit flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-2 sm:px-6 sm:py-3 sm:text-lg font-medium text-background bg-primary rounded-full perfect-shadow hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group"
        >
          Connect with me
          <div
            class="z-[-1] bg-gradient-to-b from-secondary via-primary to-primary absolute w-[calc(100%-4px)] h-[calc(100%-4px)] rounded-full border-t-2 border-secondary group-hover:border-primary transition-colors duration-300"
          >
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fade-in 1s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .animate-slide-in-left {
    animation: slide-in-left 0.8s ease-out forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .animate-slide-in-right {
    animation: slide-in-right 0.8s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .animate-text-reveal {
    animation: text-reveal 0.6s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .animate-text-fade-in {
    animation: text-fade-in 0.8s ease-out 0.8s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .animate-button-slide-up {
    animation: button-slide-up 0.6s ease-out 1s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
  }

  @keyframes fade-in {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes slide-in-left {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-50px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @keyframes slide-in-right {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(50px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @keyframes text-reveal {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes text-fade-in {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes button-slide-up {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .border:hover {
      animation: gentle-rotate 6s linear infinite;
    }
  }

  @keyframes gentle-rotate {
    from { transform: rotate(6deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(6deg) rotateY(360deg); }
  }
</style>